      "message": "`__PKVM_HYP__` is enabled when we the pKVM is enabled via CONFIG through:\n`arch/x86/kvm/vmx/pkvm/hyp/Makefile`\n`ccflags-y +\u003d -D__PKVM_HYP__ `\n\nbut what if it is enabled as above but disabled (not enabled) via `kvm-intel.pkvm\u003d1` command line?",
